## ConsoleAppShortcut

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Dotnet.Models`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Dotnet`

### Purpose
Implements `IShortcut` to provide a UI shortcut for creating new .NET C# Console Application development conversations.

### Class Definition

```csharp
internal class ConsoleAppShortcut : IShortcut
{
    public ConsoleAppShortcut(DialogService dialog, IKernelController kernel, NavigationManager nav);

    public string Title => "Console App";
    public string Description => "Develop a .NET C# Console Application.";
    public string Icon => "bi bi-terminal";
    public string Color => "primary";
    public string Category => ".NET";
    public string[] Tags => ["C#", "csproj"];

    public async Task OnClick();
}
```

### OnClick Behavior
1. Creates a new `ChatConfiguration` with:
   - `AssistantModeId = DevelopOptions.AssistantModeId` ( `"developer"` )
   - `BuilderId = DotnetOptions.CsConsoleApp` ( `"cs-console-app"` )
   - `Icon = "bi bi-terminal"`
   - `Group = ".NET Development"`
2. Shows the `DotnetCsConfig` modal dialog for project selection.
3. On `DialogResult.Yes`, calls `_kernel.Create(model)` and navigates to `converse/{model.Id}`.

### Registration
Registered via `CyrenaBuilderExtensions.AddDotnetDevelopment()`:
```csharp
builder.AddShortcut<ConsoleAppShortcut>();
```

### Related Types
- `DotnetCsConfig` — Blazor dialog for selecting `.csproj` file
- `ConsoleAppSolutionBuilder` — `ICodeBuilder` for configuring the project
- `ConsoleAppProjectType` — `IDotnetProjectType` for detecting console apps
